  '點擊海面航行；第三人稱右鍵拖曳環視': 'Tap the sea to sail; in third person, drag with the right button to look',
  '點擊綠色格子放置 · R 旋轉 · Esc 取消': 'Tap a green cell to place · R rotate · Esc cancel',
  '點擊綠色格子放置；拖曳畫面環視': 'Tap a green cell to place; drag the view to look around',
  點視角鈕: 'Tap the view button',
  '（……先別慌。社畜的基本功：先盤點資源。靠近漂流木箱，按 E 打撈吧。還差 {0} 件。）':
    "(…Don't panic. First rule of office life: take stock. Get close to the drifting crates and press E to salvage. {0} more to go.)",
  '（一切都準備好了。建造選單最下面那張藍圖——「戰艦」。把避難所與小艇融合吧，材料可不便宜，先存夠再說。）':
    '(Everything\'s ready. The blueprint at the very bottom of the build menu — "Warship". Fuse the shelter and the boat. The materials aren\'t cheap, so stock up first.)',
  '（以前老闆總愛說「擴大規模」……這次是為了自己。地基還差 {0} 格，避難所最多撐得起 20 格。）':
    '(My old boss loved to say "scale up"… this time it\'s for me. {0} more floor tiles; the shelter can hold up to 20.)',
  '（免登入單機模式）': ' (offline mode, no sign-in)',
  '（喉嚨好乾。海水不能直接喝——蓋集水蒸餾器，記得回來點它取水。）':
    "(My throat is so dry. You can't drink seawater — build a water still, and remember to come back and tap it for water.)",
  '（夥伴越來越多了。展示池還差 {0} 座，上限是 5 座。）':
    '(More and more partners. {0} more pens to go; the limit is 5.)',
  '（太陽下山會很冷……用漂流木和纖維搭一座帆布避難所，至少能遮風避雨、恢復體力。）':
    "(It'll be cold when the sun goes down… build a canvas shelter from driftwood and fiber, at least to keep off the wind and rain and recover.)",
  '（小艇只有 LV {0}。船體要升到 3 級，才撐得住融合時的重量。御獸遠航 → 航務與遺跡可以升級。）':
    '(The boat is only LV {0}. The hull needs level 3 to take the weight of the fusion. Upgrade it under Expedition → Voyages & relics.)',
  '（從通勤機車到比斯泰德號……第二次人生，好像也不壞。去更遠的海看看吧。）':
    "(From a commuter scooter to the Beastidal… a second life isn't so bad after all. Let's see the farther sea.)",
  '（最下面兩層是物資艙。把用不到的材料存進去，背包就輕鬆多了。）':
    "(The bottom two decks are cargo holds. Store what I don't need and my bag gets much lighter.)",
  '（有了領地，就需要一座能停大船的碼頭。建造選單多了「船隻停靠站」，蓋在木筏邊緣。）':
    '(With a territory, I need a dock for a big ship. The build menu now has a "Ship dock" — put it on the raft\'s edge.)',
  '（木筏小得連轉身都難。按 B 打開建造，在綠色格子接上浮動地基，先擴建 2 格。）':
    '(The raft is too small to even turn around. Press B to build and attach floating floors on the green cells — expand by 2 first.)',
  '（東北方那個一閃一閃的光點……是人造的浮標？駕艇過去按 E 調查看看。）':
    '(That blinking light to the north-east… a man-made buoy? Sail over and press E to investigate.)',
  '（湖心東側最深的水域，有東西在沉城上方游動……有艦砲和夥伴，或許能贏。掌舵時按空白鍵發射艦砲。）':
    '(In the deepest water east of the lake centre, something circles above the sunken city… with the cannon and my partners, maybe we can win. Press Space at the helm to fire.)',
  '（牠還不完全信任我。按 K 打開御獸遠航：訓練、帶牠一起出海採集，羈絆到 30 就能並肩作戰。）':
    "(It doesn't fully trust me yet. Press K for Expedition: train it, take it gathering at sea; at bond 30 we can fight side by side.)",
  '（甲板下第三層是御獸休息室。停在領地附近時，到管理台讓夥伴登船，牠們會陪我遠航。）':
    "(The third deck down is the beast lounge. When we're docked near the territory, use the console to bring partners aboard and they'll sail with me.)",
  '（研究紀錄說，牠們不是怪物。先蓋一座海洋展示池，給牠們一個能回來的家。）':
    "(The research notes say they aren't monsters. Build a sea pen first, a home they can come back to.)",
  '（背包做幾份誘餌，靠近溫和的生物，每 18 秒餵一次。跑業務練出來的耐心，原來能用在這裡。）':
    '(Make some bait in the bag, approach a gentle creature and feed it every 18 s. All that patience from sales work finally pays off.)',
  '（與其等人來找我，不如讓整片海知道我在這裡。異晶收集夠了，就蓋遠洋訊號塔。）':
    "(Instead of waiting to be found, let the whole sea know I'm here. Once I have enough crystal, build the ocean signal tower.)",
  '（訊號塔應該能掃描遠方。點它試試，或打開日誌 J 設定島嶼航線。）':
    '(The signal tower should be able to scan far away. Try tapping it, or open the logbook (J) to set island routes.)',
  '（這艘船比公司大樓還高。駕駛室在船尾最上層——走主甲板後方的樓梯上去，握住舵輪才能出航。）':
    '(This ship is taller than my old office building. The bridge is on the top deck at the stern — take the stairs at the back of the main deck and grab the wheel to sail.)',
  '（那些島嶼……如果夥伴們能在那裡安心休息就好了。派出羈絆 30 的夥伴，登島走到中央石碑，按 E 插旗占領。）':
    '(Those islands… it would be nice if my partners could rest there safely. Send out a bond-30 partner, walk to the central stone and press E to plant the flag.)',
  '（龍骨正在海面下成形……再等一下，我的第二個家要出航了。）':
    '(The keel is taking shape under the sea… just a little longer and my second home sets sail.)',
