  'BEASTIDAL · 遊戲介紹': 'BEASTIDAL · ABOUT THE GAME',
  '剛畢業的你，騎車上班途中被砂石車撞上。醒來時，世界只剩下一片湖海、一塊漂流木，和水裡未知的呼吸。':
    'Fresh out of school, you were hit by a gravel truck riding to work. When you wake, the world is only water, a piece of driftwood, and something unknown breathing beneath.',
  '撈起漂流物、搭起木筏，在湖上活下來；餵食野生生物建立信任，用外出籠帶牠們回家；讓牠們配種出比斯基因，再以契約契闊進化成御獸——騎乘、潛水、並肩戰鬥。':
    'Haul in flotsam, build a raft and survive on the water; feed wild creatures to earn their trust and bring them home in a carry cage; breed BS genes into them, then evolve them by contract into beasts — to ride, dive and fight beside you.',
  '手機請橫屏遊玩 · 建議戴上耳機 · 支援鍵鼠／觸控／手把 · 免登入即可遊玩':
    'Play in landscape on phones · headphones recommended · keyboard/mouse, touch and gamepad · no sign-in needed',
  '歪計劃工作室 YZProJect': 'YZProJect Studio',
  'YZPJ（YZProJect，歪計劃工作室）是製作《比斯泰德 Beastidal》的獨立團隊。':
    'YZPJ (YZProJect) is the independent team making Beastidal.',
  '我們想做一款讓人慢下來的遊戲：在陌生的水域裡生活、照顧牠們、看牠們長大。':
    'We wanted a game that lets you slow down: live on strange waters, care for the creatures, and watch them grow.',
